  "subtitle": "Comprehensive Turkish luxury watch market data with 1,670 products and 42 optimized features",
  "description": "This premium dataset contains detailed information about 1,670 luxury watches from 22 prestigious brands, scraped from SamiWatches - one of Turkey's leading luxury watch retailers. The dataset has been professionally cleaned, optimized, and enhanced with advanced analytics features including improved price categorization, brand prestige levels, and technical specifications. Perfect for machine learning projects, market analysis, and luxury goods research.\n\nKey improvements in this optimized version:\n- Enhanced data completeness (96.71%)\n- Optimized memory usage (3.23 MB)\n- Improved price categorization (5 balanced categories)\n- Added brand prestige analysis\n- Standardized categorical data\n- New technical features (case diameter analysis)\n- Zero duplicate records",
